\b Out-Switch 0.6.0 - Routing test build\b0\par\par
Created by HosseinSKR.\par\par
Installs the native desktop app, background service, signed WinDivert networking component, application icon and dependency licenses. Windows 10 2004+ or Windows 11 Intel/AMD x64 is required. Installation needs administrator permission.\par\par
\b Live routing validation is still pending.\b0\par
The new TCP/UDP relay and bandwidth controls are implemented, but driver loading was denied in the build environment. Test the app on your PC before relying on routing. Network Control starts ON on a fresh installation.\par\par
QoS marks outgoing traffic; routers decide whether to prioritize it. No guaranteed local priority scheduler is included. Existing connections must reconnect after rule changes.\par\par
Close the old app before installing. Settings stay on this PC; uninstall preserves them. No telemetry, TLS decryption or payload recording.\par\par
Out-Switch: MIT license. WinDivert: LGPL version 3 or later; matching source, license and notices are included. The app/installer are not yet publisher-signed.\par\par
